OL,3,AIsraeli attacks have turned Gaza into
OL,4,A'toxic wasteland', Oxfam says
OL,5,
OL,6,FGaza has been turned into "a toxic
OL,7,Fwasteland", with more than 99% of the
OL,8,FPalestinian territory showing
OL,9,Findicators of environmental
OL,10,Fcontamination from Israeli military
OL,11,Fattacks, a new report from the
OL,12,Fnon-profit organisation Oxfam says.
OL,14,FHeavy metals, explosive residues, and
OL,15,Fasbestos from destroyed buildings,
OL,16,Fdioxins and biological contaminants in
OL,17,Fthe air, soil and water supply are
OL,18,Fthreats to Palestinians now and
OL,19,Fpotentially for decades to come, it
OL,20,Fsays.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
